# Per-autorandr-profile polybar role override (Story 5.5, #152).
#
# Copy to <autorandr-profile-name>.env in this directory. launch.sh merges it
# ON TOP of the monitor-roles heuristic: a role set here wins, a role left out
# keeps the heuristic's pick, and an empty value clears the role so its bar
# doesn't launch. Values are xrandr monitor names ([A-Za-z0-9._~-] only);
# any other line is ignored with a warning (`monitor-roles merge-env` is the
# filter — it has clitest coverage and never executes file contents).
#
# The classic use: virtual-split docking layouts the heuristic can't infer.
#MONITOR_MAIN=DP1-1
#MONITOR_LEFT=eDP1
#MONITOR_SPLIT_TOP=DP1-2~1
#MONITOR_SPLIT_BOTTOM=DP1-2~2
#MONITOR_EXTRA=
